Modules:

Parser Module:
- grabs the information from the RPI, splits into whichever registers are needed in order to then be fed into the dsp module

DSP Module:
- actually doing the dsp math
- made up of two inputs that are then multiplied, the bit information as well as the corresponding coefficient for the information
- then, we have the carry out from the previous which is then fed out to the output

PMOD Interface Module:
- take the output from the dsp and uses it to talk to the PMOD to actually play the module
